.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-handed</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 0 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  0           gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)</li></ul>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\">Pact of the Blade</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action DC\">weapon action DC</a> of the summoned Pact Weapon still uses <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041813\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.108 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4452/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 77867/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argumen